ta","data":[{"unit":1,"title":126,"area":127,"prev":129,"next":132,"titles":134,"firmware":303},{"id":2,"title":3,"aliases":4,"area":11,"order":12,"path":13,"context":14,"summary":20,"status":21,"firmware":22,"facts":27,"procedures":47,"parameters":106,"related":107,"body":112,"sources":113,"official_url":31,"controls":117},"howto.wobble","Recipe — a filter wobble in time with the beat",[5,6,7,8,9,10],"wobble","wobble bass","lfo on cutoff","filter wobble","rhythmic filter","auto filter","howto",43,"knowledge/manual/units/howto/wobble.md",{"modes":15,"screens":17},[16],"instrument",[18,19],"M4","M3","Pick the value LFO on `M4`, aim it at the cutoff on the filter page and give it a tempo-synced speed; the amount sets how far the filter swings.","current",{"min":23,"changed_in":24,"guide_version":25,"verified_on":26},"1.0.9",[],"1.1.15",null,[28,33,37,40,43],{"id":29,"text":30,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"value","The value LFO turns one encoder of the track's pages up and down by itself, like a hand moving the knob in a loop.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#lfo","derived",{"id":34,"text":35,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":36},"target","Destination on `E3` picks the page, filter for a wobble, and parameter on `E4` picks the encoder there; cutoff is the first of the filter page's four.","official",{"id":38,"text":39,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":36},"synced","Over the anti-clockwise part of its range the speed follows the tempo, so the wobble stays locked to the beat.",{"id":41,"text":42,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":36},"restart","On the plain filter destination the wobble restarts with every note, so each note wobbles the same way; its free twin keeps running across notes.",{"id":44,"text":45,"source":46,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"audible","A moderate cutoff with some resonance on `M3` makes the sweep easy to hear; with the cutoff fully open there is little left to move.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#filter",[48,90],{"id":49,"goal":50,"preconditions":51,"steps":53,"result":26,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"set-up","Make the filter on `T3` wobble in time",[52],"instrument mode",[54,56,59,62,67,72,78,84],{"keys":55,"note":26,"set":26},"T3 → M4",{"keys":57,"note":58,"set":26},"shift + M4","the LFO types",{"keys":60,"note":61,"set":26},"turn E1","highlight value",{"keys":63,"note":64,"set":65},"click E1","takes it; press `M4` if the page changed",{"param":66,"value":29},"lfo type",{"keys":60,"note":68,"set":69},"a synced speed, such as 4",{"param":70,"value":71},"lfo speed",4,{"keys":73,"note":74,"set":75},"turn E2","amount around 60",{"param":76,"value":77},"lfo amount",60,{"keys":79,"note":80,"set":81},"turn E3","destination filter",{"param":82,"value":83},"lfo destination","filter",{"keys":85,"note":86,"set":87},"turn E4","parameter 1, the cutoff",{"param":88,"value":89},"lfo parameter",1,{"id":44,"goal":91,"preconditions":92,"steps":93,"result":26,"source":46,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"Give the wobble something to move",[],[94,96,101],{"keys":19,"note":95,"set":26},"press it again if the page shows off",{"keys":60,"note":97,"set":98},"cutoff around 40",{"param":99,"value":100},"cutoff",40,{"keys":73,"note":102,"set":103},"resonance around 45",{"param":104,"value":105},"resonance",45,[],[108,109,110,111],"instrument.lfo-value","instrument.lfo","instrument.filter","howto.acid-bass","A wobble is a filter sweep that repeats in time, the sound of a hand rocking the cutoff knob back\nand forth. Faster synced speeds make it busier, slower ones turn it into a long rise and fall over\nthe bar. Parameter locks on the LFO speed for single steps give the classic change of pace in the\nmiddle of a phrase.",[114,116],{"url":31,"kind":115},"guide",{"url":46,"kind":115},[118,119,120,121,122,123